  informationID: waterworks_drainage_condition
  informationTitle: Condition of the Drainage Channel
  informationSource: North County Waterworks
  informationDescription: The lower drainage channel contains mineral staining, worn concrete, and sections that appear to have been patched at different times. There is no visible date or inspection label on the repairs. Their condition alone cannot establish when the work was carried out or whether it relates to WW-91-184.
